{#
  The « Rappels » section of an asset's settings (§6.29, §22.11).

  A summary first (issue #1355, D15): how many reminders are active for
  each recipient, which delays this asset changes, which reminders it
  switches off. The thirteen fields live in the « Modifier les rappels »
  dialog, each named with who it goes to — « Aux gestionnaires du bien » or
  « Au locataire », from ReminderKind::isInternal(). Without a reachable
  manager the internal ones still go to the Staff d'U; the screen does not
  say so.

  **An empty delay means « prends le défaut de l'unité », never « jamais ».**
  Thirteen fields on every asset are thirteen fields nobody fills in, so a
  blank one has to keep working — and the unit's number is written
  underneath, so what a manager reads is what would actually apply rather
  than a value they would have to keep in step by hand. Turning a reminder
  off is the checkbox's job: a remorque has neither an inventory nor a
  security deposit, and those reminders on it are guaranteed noise.

  Requires `asset`, `reminders` and `csrf_token`.
#}
{% set managers_active = reminders|filter(r => r.internal and r.active)|length %}
{% set renter_active = reminders|filter(r => not r.internal and r.active)|length %}
{% set customised = reminders|filter(r => r.days is not null) %}
{% set switched_off = reminders|filter(r => not r.active) %}
<div class="card mb-4" id="rappels">
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2 mb-1">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-0">Rappels</h2>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#rappels-edit">
                <i class="bi bi-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Modifier
            </button>
        </div>

        <dl class="row mb-0 mt-2">
            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Aux gestionnaires du bien</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8" data-reminders-managers>
                {{ managers_active }} rappel{{ managers_active > 1 ? 's' : '' }} actif{{ managers_active > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
            </dd>

            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Au locataire</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8" data-reminders-renter>
                {{ renter_active }} rappel{{ renter_active > 1 ? 's' : '' }} actif{{ renter_active > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
            </dd>

            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Délais personnalisés</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8">
                {% for reminder in customised %}
                    {{ reminder.label }} : {{ reminder.days }} j (défaut {{ reminder.default_days }}){% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                {% else %}
                    Aucun
                {% endfor %}
            </dd>

            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Désactivés</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8">
                {% for reminder in switched_off %}
                    {{ reminder.label }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                {% else %}
                    Aucun
                {% endfor %}
            </dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="form-text mb-0">Les autres rappels suivent les délais par défaut de l'unité.</p>
    </div>
</div>

{# Outside the card: a modal nested in one inherits its stacking context. #}
{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'rappels-edit',
    title: 'Modifier les rappels',
    section_editor: true,
    size: 'lg',
    scrollable: true,
    asset: asset,
    reminders: reminders,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/rappels" id="reminders-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <p class="form-text mt-0">
                Un délai vide reprend la valeur par défaut, indiquée sous le champ ; <strong>0</strong> veut
                dire « le jour même ». Décochez un rappel pour ne pas l'envoyer pour ce bien.
            </p>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-3">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Rappel et destinataire</th>
                            <th scope="col" style="width: 10rem;">Délai (jours)</th>
                            <th scope="col" style="width: 7rem;">Actif</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for reminder in reminders %}
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <label class="form-label mb-0" for="reminder-days-{{ reminder.key }}">
                                        {{ reminder.label }}
                                    </label>
                                    <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block" data-reminder-recipient>
                                        {{ reminder.internal ? 'Aux gestionnaires du bien' : 'Au locataire' }}
                                    </span>
                                    {% if reminder.repeats %}
                                        <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">Répété tant que la situation dure.</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0"
                                           class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                           id="reminder-days-{{ reminder.key }}"
                                           name="days_{{ reminder.key }}"
                                           value="{{ reminder.days is null ? '' : reminder.days }}"
                                           placeholder="{{ reminder.default_days }}"
                                           aria-describedby="reminder-default-{{ reminder.key }}">
                                    <div class="form-text" id="reminder-default-{{ reminder.key }}">
                                        défaut : {{ reminder.default_days }} jour{{ reminder.default_days > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"
                                               id="reminder-active-{{ reminder.key }}"
                                               name="active_{{ reminder.key }}" value="1"
                                               {{ reminder.active ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                                        <label class="form-check-label visually-hidden"
                                               for="reminder-active-{{ reminder.key }}">
                                            Envoyer « {{ reminder.label }} » pour ce bien
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <p class="form-text mb-0">
                Les valeurs par défaut de l'unité se règlent dans « Configuration &gt; Réglages »,
                section Locations. La passe tourne une fois par jour : un délai se compte en
                jours, jamais en heures.
            </p>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="reminders-form" class="btn btn-primary">Enregistrer les rappels</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
